<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cytec Industries cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cytec Industries cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs said it downgraded Cytec Industries Inc to market outperform and removed the stock from the recommended list.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Cytec lost 2-3/4 to 37-1/4.</p>
</text>
